# Relationship With GUI

GUI is built on top of these principles:

A button:

```text
Button object
       |
       v
Rectangle geometry
       |
       v
Rasterization
       |
       v
Pixels on screen
```

When clicked:

```text
Pixels
  |
  v
Mouse event
  |
  v
Application logic
```

So:

```text
Computer Graphics
        |
        v
GUI Framework
        |
        v
Desktop Applications
```

